### Add a book
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Effective Java",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "category": "Programming",
  "availableCopies": 4
}

### Get all books
GET http://localhost:8080/books

### Get one book
GET http://localhost:8080/books/1

### Missing book returns 404
GET http://localhost:8080/books/999

### Update a book
PUT http://localhost:8080/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Effective Java, Third Edition",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "category": "Programming",
  "availableCopies": 6
}

### Missing book update returns 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/books/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "title": "Missing Book",
  "author": "Nobody",
  "category": "Unknown",
  "availableCopies": 0
}

### Delete a book
DELETE http://localhost:8080/books/1

### Missing book delete returns 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/books/999
